{"title":"American Junior High School Mathematics Examination","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=American_Junior_High_School_Mathematics_Examination&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p><p>The <b>American Junior High School Mathematics Examination</b> (<b>AJHSME</b>) was the predecessor of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8\" title=\"AMC 8\">AMC 8</a>, administered by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Mathematics_Competitions\" title=\"American Mathematics Competitions\">American Mathematics Competitions</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Junior_High_School_Mathematics_Examination&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://math.llmlab.io/\">AJHSME Online Tests and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AJHSME Problems and Solutions\">AJHSME Problems and Solutions</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Junior_High_School_Mathematics_Examination&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math